<anchor xml:id="_motor__driver_8c_1a20d545bdb85184d9810dd083450e9fa7"/><section>
    <title>motor_set_duty_cycle()</title>
<indexterm><primary>motor_set_duty_cycle</primary><secondary>motor_driver.c</secondary></indexterm>
<indexterm><primary>motor_driver.c</primary><secondary>motor_set_duty_cycle</secondary></indexterm>
<para><computeroutput>void motor_set_duty_cycle (<link linkend="_structmotor__t">motor_t</link> * p_mot, int8_t duty_cycle)</computeroutput></para><para>

<para>Set the motor drive duty cycle. </para>
</para>

<para>Set the motor duty cycle as a percentage of the timer period.</para>

<para>The duty cycle is converted from a percentage to a timer compare value using the timer auto-reload register. The second output channel is set to zero.</para>

